apons/a-80055887--3e6bd65b24cc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/kim-jong-un-tours-nuclear-material-sites-urges-wider-use-of-tactical-nuclear-weapons/a-80055887?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea's Kim Jong Un visited sites that produce nuclear material and told his military to focus on tactical weapons, saying his country's nuclear status is irreversible.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Extreme weather threatens Thanksgiving festivities in US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8e9f9d1c1a5fe99562118b87aaaa80e89eb0a9331298b8aaf8f702805067e4d5</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T02:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/extreme-weather-threatens-thanksgiving-festivities-in-us/a-80055880--04519a33e0ed.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/extreme-weather-threatens-thanksgiving-festivities-in-us/a-80055880?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A major storm is forecast to move up the US East Coast and is likely to cause travel delays. Weather warnings were enough to postpone Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade for the first time in its 100 years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Duran Duran guitarist Andy Taylor dies at 65</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f91d7592866c61c0ca49c263bc2565bef69509260f2160877835016ceb7ec22c</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T22:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/duran-duran-guitarist-andy-taylor-dies-at-65/a-80055654--e1b7f742aed7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/duran-duran-guitarist-andy-taylor-dies-at-65/a-80055654?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Andy Taylor first revealed he was battling cancer in 2022 when Duran Duran was inducted into the Rock &amp;amp; Roll Hall of Fame. The band had numerous hits 