imate science and disinformation risk delaying key measures at COP31 in Antalya. As the UN climate talks draw to a close, how will that affect efforts to come to an agreement?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Has the 'Parthenon puzzle' been solved? The long quest to reassemble lost eastern pediment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da13b720fb87686aee7efa75ba6cf2badca341c71b827c959e47adfe6c6e580a</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098--4f23b2ccbfc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The depiction of the birth of the goddess Athena above the Parthenon's entrance is considered a masterpiece of ancient art. Now, a German research team has pieced together all the surviving fragments.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Better educated than ever — yet Germany's Gen Z is being shut out of its own future</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a51f98fb6ffd49b1e5fae0d4e495329e3e42fc279c0ab9e70dac3cdb7a77540c</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T17:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/better-educated-than-ever-yet-germany-s-gen-z-is-being-shut-out-of-its-own-future/a-80005823--59d88b978f2b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/better-educated-than-ever-yet-germany-s-gen-z-is-being-shut-out-of-its-own-future/a-80005823?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Never before have young people around the world been so well-educated while facing so many economic challenges. Young Germans are asking: Will I be better off than my parents?</summary><catego