a, which it denies.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Borussia Dortmund's Felix Nmecha and the question of religion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f36120b23d51b59c691959a355ce2fb95d9d7fcaab26725215f7da06aeffad83</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T11:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-s-felix-nmecha-and-the-question-of-religion/a-79900432--cd7bb6e11389.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-s-felix-nmecha-and-the-question-of-religion/a-79900432?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Felix Nmecha's "Crowns down" celebration has drawn criticism from a Borussia Dortmund fan club, reopening debate over faith, inclusion and religious messaging in football.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Why electrification is the climate game changer we need</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8cede6bf2b4894e6745a515b8505919b8b5d3031b2cc25334785cbadff5623d6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T08:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-electrification-is-the-climate-game-changer-we-need/a-79615979--0dbca6445640.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-electrification-is-the-climate-game-changer-we-need/a-79615979?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From EVs and electric buses on the road, heat pumps warming homes and solar panels powering appliances, the shift to electrifying tech is already in full swing. But what exactly does "electrification" mean?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Will Australia push for fossil fuel exit at UN talks?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dd8e67dd000aa4476b1751f009c2154feec11020adaecfa373fde55e2b38cf3c</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T07:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pag